# Changes to these paths need the owner's review before they merge.
#
# The worker host runs agents with unrestricted shells on people's PCs, and a
# host installs whatever the project key signed. So every change to it is
# looked at by a person, not only the release file that names it.
/worker-host/                 @NZCypher819

# Whatever signs or names a release, wherever it sits.
release.toml                  @NZCypher819
release.toml.sig              @NZCypher819

# This rule, the checks that are required to pass, and the secrets scan's
# exceptions, so none of them can be changed in the pull request that needs
# them changed.
/.github/CODEOWNERS           @NZCypher819
/.github/workflows/           @NZCypher819
/.gitleaksignore              @NZCypher819
